WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.147
Hi, I'm V.

00:00:01.147 --> 00:00:02.959
This is Green Leaf Kitchen.

00:00:02.959 --> 00:00:04.771
It's not a real restaurant.

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:11.888
It's our sample, built to show you what a Vegan restaurant's website can look like when we build it with you.

00:00:11.888 --> 00:00:14.023
Watch the tour, then tap around.

00:00:14.023 --> 00:00:15.964
Nothing you do here is saved.

00:00:16.414 --> 00:00:22.618
The first screen answers what people want to know: are you open, what's good, and how do I order.

00:00:22.618 --> 00:00:28.117
The favorites row is ranked by what members vote for, so it stays current on its own.

00:00:28.567 --> 00:00:31.880
People choose a restaurant for the people behind it.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:38.442
Your story plays right on the page, and your space shows by day, at night, inside, and with your team.

00:00:38.892 --> 00:00:40.702
Every dish has its own page.

00:00:40.702 --> 00:00:46.523
Allergens, a nutrition estimate, and what's in it, with where each ingredient comes from.

00:00:46.523 --> 00:00:50.856
When it's a brand in our Directory, it links to that brand's page.

00:00:51.306 --> 00:00:56.048
Members of Vegans Explore can sign in here with the account they already have.

00:00:56.048 --> 00:01:01.702
They vote for their favorite dishes once a day and save the ones they want to come back for.

00:01:02.152 --> 00:01:06.204
Switch to the owner, and the same page becomes yours to update.

00:01:06.204 --> 00:01:11.478
Change an ingredient, add a brand from our Directory, and the dish page shows it.

00:01:11.928 --> 00:01:13.212
Ordering is short.

00:01:13.212 --> 00:01:16.281
Add what you want, choose pickup, and pay.

00:01:16.281 --> 00:01:21.561
When your point of sale is connected, orders go straight to your kitchen.

00:01:21.561 --> 00:01:24.415
Vegans Explore Delivery is coming soon.

00:01:24.865 --> 00:01:27.215
This is one site in three looks.

00:01:27.215 --> 00:01:30.887
Same menu, same story, different colors and type.

00:01:30.887 --> 00:01:33.825
Yours is built from your own brand kit.

00:01:34.275 --> 00:01:41.380
Your site connects to your Vegans Explore page, where members find you, vote for you, and check in when they visit.

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:44.232
Your regulars become your community.

00:01:44.232 --> 00:01:52.906
Members unlock rewards you choose, like a free drink or a seat at your chef's table, with the points they earn on Vegans Explore.

00:01:52.906 --> 00:01:56.242
There are only so many, first come, first served.

00:01:56.242 --> 00:02:03.982
And your club is a Guide on Vegans Explore, so it brings people in and sends them out to the rest of the community.

00:02:04.432 --> 00:02:06.790
Want one like this for your restaurant?

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:10.780
Tap Talk to our team, and a real person will walk you through it.
